      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17165/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, ginger, baking soda, cinnamon, cloves, and salt together into a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-roQFmiN4h1glInG7m_nz7a4qGo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17165-Big-Soft-Ginger-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-02-1151-7a1985c4b5ac47408a5ac83b5084de7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17165/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and 1 cup sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Beat in egg; stir in molasses and water. Gradually stir flour-spice mixture into molasses mixture until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i8JH4tRTPmvoWnoDvD9WoK-pqBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17165-Big-Soft-Ginger-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-04b-1156-6c68af00bb634d7c92a2c8e690cdb748.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17165/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape dough into 24 walnut-sized balls with floured hands. Roll each ball in the reserved sugar to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kbyCDsn5Sqdz8NYZF-vRMb6ySHw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17165-Big-Soft-Ginger-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-05b-1158-04d6ac2d61cc42cfac7386a2b82b9cdc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17165/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cookies 2 inches apart on ungreased cookie sheets; flatten slightly with the bottom of a glass.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lDCCs6Nx0HrrkUnBlik3Kkpartk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17165-Big-Soft-Ginger-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-06-1159-67f6f224862a46fabf3f455b8249d9d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17165/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops crack and centers are soft, 8 to 10 minutes, switching racks halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven; let cool on the baking sheets for 5 minutes, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
